 "text": "Hi, how have you been? That's exciting and brave. Do they have tents and gear? Then encourage her to lead a bit, and pair up the shy ones together. Agree on a get back time every night, and tell her to stay at the car until she's comfortable. Probably, with a bit of bush wall between you and the street. Sure, go ahead. That's wise. Check in every hour or two, and leave her your mobile number for night checks. Encourage the older girl to check in too, as a leader.",
